WEBVTT

00:13:29.018 --> 00:13:30.856
It's not going to change anytime soon.

00:13:30.880 --> 00:13:33.143
They might discover
some new quantum mechanics,

00:13:33.167 --> 00:13:35.823
but apples right here
are still going to fall down.

00:13:35.847 --> 00:13:37.970
So, the question is --

00:13:37.994 --> 00:13:40.283
I get asked sometimes: How do you start?

00:13:40.307 --> 00:13:41.528
What's the place to start

00:13:41.552 --> 00:13:44.808
if you're interested in the physical
world, in not being helpless,

00:13:44.832 --> 00:13:46.669
and in finding some toys to play with?

00:13:46.693 --> 00:13:49.097
Here is my suggestion to you:

00:13:49.121 --> 00:13:54.520
the place to start is that moment --
and adults do this --

00:13:54.544 --> 00:13:56.406
you're drifting along somewhere,

00:13:56.430 --> 00:14:00.021
and you spot something
and your brain goes, "Oh, that's weird."